## Summary

**3 plan files, 9 tasks** written to `.planning/phases/01-worker-foundation-binance-spike/`:

| Plan | Wave | Depends | Tasks | Covers |
|------|------|---------|-------|--------|
| `01-01-PLAN.md` (foundation) | 1 | — | 3 | INFRA-01, INFRA-05 → SC1, SC4 |
